# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Exported per-NTA drill-down data (tract/route/facility) -- the raw
# per-NTA route exports in routes/ (every sport x both time windows x every
# route option) run ~548MB total and are pipeline intermediate output, not
# something the frontend ever fetches directly -- stay ignored. tracts/ is
# only ~8MB total for all 262 NTAs, so it's committed in full. routes/ only
# un-ignores the pre-filtered weekday_evening slice per NTA per
# display-level sport (see scripts/extract_sport_weekday_evening_routes.py)
# -- the only window NtaRouteDetail.tsx renders, for whichever sport is
# selected -- not the raw per-NTA files above. No raw file ends in
# "_weekday_evening.geojson" (they're bare "{NTA}.geojson"), so one glob
# covers every sport without listing all 21 display-level names. Originally
# un-ignored for just soccer + Elmhurst's (QN0401) worked example (per
# project owner instruction, 2026-10-06 and 2026-11-18); widened to every
# sport per project owner instruction, 2026-11-19, after a teammate found
# only soccer's routes had been committed.
/public/data/routes/*
!/public/data/routes/*_weekday_evening.geojson
# facilities/ keeps the 24 raw per-column exports (adult_base.geojson,
# flagfootba.geojson, ll_baseb_1.geojson, etc.) ignored -- only the 21
# merged display-level files SPORT_TYPE_GROUPS produces (see
# export_dashboard_data.py's export_facilities_by_sport()) are fetched by
# the frontend. Their names don't share a glob-friendly pattern distinct
# from the raw ones, so they're listed explicitly instead.
/public/data/facilities/*
!/public/data/facilities/adult_baseball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/adult_football.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/adult_softball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/basketball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/bocce.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/cricket.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/frisbee.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/handball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/hockey.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/kickball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/lacrosse.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/netball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/pickleball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/rugby.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/soccer.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/tennis.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/track_and_field.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/volleyball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/youth_baseball.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/youth_football.geojson
!/public/data/facilities/youth_softball.geojson
/public/data/nta_boundaries.geojson
